<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113951" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθιζ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθές</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of yesterday,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χ. χρεῖος</span> their
			<i>yesterday's</i> debt, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.745
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ χ. πόνος</span>
			<i>yesterday's</i> labour, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.126
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χ. μέθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.13e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ χ. ἀβελτερίαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				75e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.40
			</span></i>, etc.: freq. in adverb. sense, with Verbs, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθιζὸς ἔβη</span> he went <i>yesterday,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.424
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἤλυθες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.262
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἐεικοστῷ φύγον ἤματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.170
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσσα . . χ. ὑπέσχετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.141
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἐμυθεόμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.451
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴδον Μέντορα χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.656
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἲ γάρ . . τοῖος ἐών τοι χ. . .
				ἐφεστάμεναι</span> would I had stood by thee <i>yesterday!</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				24.379
			</span></i>: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθιζόν</span> as
			Adv., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθές</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.195
			</span></i>; neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθιζά,</span>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωιζός.</span>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
